! Install tw-nowledge

Open this website and your target TiddlyWiki side by side. Drag each plugin card below by its double-chevron handle into the target wiki, select Import, then save and reload the wiki.

The same drag-and-drop installation works for:

* a static HTML TiddlyWiki;
* a Node.js TiddlyWiki.

!! 1. Markdown Transformer

Required for WikiText pulls.

<$let plugin-type="plugin"
	default-popup-state="no"
	qualified-state=<<qualify "$:/state/install-plugin-info">>
>
<$list filter="[[$:/plugins/linonetwo/markdown-transformer]]">
{{||$:/core/ui/Components/plugin-info}}
</$list>
</$let>

